          \uBD84\uBE44\uD55C\uB2E4."
        En: A jelly-type monster commonly found in Evergreen Forest. Secretes toxic
          slime.
      - Id: 8003
        StringId: MON_002_NAME
        Ko: "\uBD88\uAF43 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784"
        En: Flame Slime
      - Id: 8004
        StringId: MON_002_DESC
        Ko: "\uC6A9\uC554 \uC9C0\uB300\uC5D0\uC11C \uD758\uB7EC\uC628 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784.
          \uBAB8\uCCB4\uAC00 \uB728\uAC81\uAC8C \uB2EC\uC544\uC62C\uB77C \uC788\uB2E4."
        En: A slime from the lava zone. Its body burns with intense heat.
      - Id: 8005
        StringId: MON_003_NAME
        Ko: "\uC232 \uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0"
        En: Forest Goblin
      - Id: 8006
        StringId: MON_003_DESC
        Ko: "\uC5D0\uBC84\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC232\uC744 \uADFC\uAC70\uC9C0\uB85C \uC0BC\uB294
          \uC18C\uD615 \uC778\uAC04\uD615 \uBAAC\uC2A4\uD130. \uBF08 \uBABD\uB465\uC774\uB97C
          \uD718\uB450\uB978\uB2E4."
        En: A small humanoid monster that calls Evergreen Forest home. Wields a bone
          club.
      - Id: 8007
        StringId: MON_004_NAME
        Ko: "\uAC70\uB300 \uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04"
        En: Giant Mushroom Man
      - Id: 8008
        StringId: MON_004_DESC
        Ko: "\uC232 \uAE4A\uC740 \uACF3\uC758 \uADE0\uB958\uC5D0\uC11C \uD0DC\uC5B4\uB09C
          \uBAAC\uC2A4\uD130. \uD3EC\uC790\uB97C \uBFDC\uC5B4 \uC2DC\uC57C\uB97C
          \uD750\uB9B0\uB2E4."
        En: A monster born from fungi deep in the forest. Releases spores to obscure
          vision.
      - Id: 8009
        StringId: MON_005_NAME
        Ko: "\uC232 \uBCF4\uC2A4 \u2014 \uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC"
        En: "Forest Boss \u2014 Green Worm"
      - Id: 8010
        StringId: MON_005_DESC
        Ko: "\uC5D0\uBC84\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC232 \uC9C0\uD558\uC5D0 \uC11C\uC2DD\uD558\uB294
          \uB300\uD615 \uC9C0\uB801\uC774 \uBAAC\uC2A4\uD130. \uB545\uC744 \uD30C\uACE0\uB4E4\uC5B4
          \uAE30\uC2B5\uD55C\uB2E4."
        En: A giant worm monster living beneath Evergreen Forest. Burrows underground
          to ambush prey.
      - Id: 8011
        StringId: ING_001_NAME
        Ko: "\uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uC824\uB9AC"
        En: Slime Jelly
      - Id: 8012
        StringId: ING_001_DESC
        Ko: "\uCD08\uB85D \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784\uC5D0\uC11C \uCC44\uCDE8\uD55C \uD22C\uBA85\uD55C
          \uC824\uB9AC. \uD0C4\uB825\uC774 \uC788\uACE0 \uB2EC\uCF64\uD558\uB2E4."
        En: Translucent jelly harvested from green slimes. Elastic and sweet.
      - Id: 8013
        StringId: ING_002_NAME
        Ko: "\uBD88\uAF43 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uCF54\uC5B4"
        En: Flame Slime Core
      - Id: 8014
        StringId: ING_002_DESC
        Ko: "\uBD88\uAF43 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784\uC758 \uD575\uC2EC \uBD80\uC704. \uC2DD\uD788\uBA74
          \uB9E4\uCF64\uD55C \uD5A5\uC774 \uB09C\uB2E4."
        En: The core of a flame slime. When cooled
      - Id: 8015
        StringId: ING_003_NAME
        Ko: "\uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0 \uBF08"
        En: Goblin Bone
      - Id: 8016
        StringId: ING_003_DESC
        Ko: "\uC232 \uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0\uC758 \uB2E8\uB2E8\uD55C \uC18C\uD615 \uBF08.
          \uC721\uC218 \uC7AC\uB8CC\uB85C \uD65C\uC6A9\uB41C\uB2E4."
        En: Small dense bones from forest goblins. Used to make rich stock.
      - Id: 8017
        StringId: ING_004_NAME
        Ko: "\uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0 \uACE0\uAE30"
        En: Goblin Meat
      - Id: 8018
        StringId: ING_004_DESC
        Ko: "\uC232 \uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0\uC758 \uC0B4\uCF54\uAE30. \uC7A1\uB0B4\uAC00
          \uC788\uC5B4 \uC190\uC9C8\uC774 \uD544\uC694\uD558\uB2E4."
        En: Flesh from forest goblins. Has a gamey smell and requires preparation.
      - Id: 8019
        StringId: ING_005_NAME
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04 \uAC13"
        En: Mushroom Cap
      - Id: 8020
        StringId: ING_005_DESC
        Ko: "\uAC70\uB300 \uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04\uC758 \uC6B0\uC0B0 \uBD80\uC704.
          \uD48D\uBBF8\uAC00 \uAE4A\uACE0 \uB450\uD23C\uD558\uB2E4."
        En: The cap of a giant mushroom man. Rich in flavor and satisfyingly thick.
      - Id: 8021
        StringId: ING_006_NAME
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04 \uD3EC\uC790"
        En: Mushroom Spore
      - Id: 8022
        StringId: ING_006_DESC
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04\uC774 \uBD84\uBE44\uD558\uB294 \uD3EC\uC790.
          \uC18C\uB7C9\uC774\uBA74 \uD5A5\uC2E0\uB8CC\uB85C \uC4F8 \uC218 \uC788\uB2E4."
        En: Spores secreted by mushroom men. In small amounts they work as seasoning.
      - Id: 8023
        StringId: ING_007_NAME
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC \uACE0\uAE30"
        En: Green Worm Meat
      - Id: 8024
        StringId: ING_007_DESC
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC\uC758 \uB300\uD615 \uC0B4\uCF54\uAE30. \uCAC4\uAE43\uD558\uACE0
          \uC601\uC591\uC774 \uD48D\uBD80\uD558\uB2E4."
        En: Large cuts of meat from the green worm. Chewy and highly nutritious.
      - Id: 8025
        StringId: ING_008_NAME
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC \uAECD\uC9C8"
        En: Green Worm Hide
      - Id: 8026
        StringId: ING_008_DESC
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC\uC758 \uB450\uAEBC\uC6B4 \uC678\uD53C. \uC624\uB798
          \uB053\uC774\uBA74 \uAD6D\uBB3C\uC774 \uC9C4\uD574\uC9C4\uB2E4."
        En: The thick outer skin of a green worm. Long boiling creates a rich broth.
      - Id: 8027
        StringId: FOOD_001_NAME
        Ko: "\uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uC824\uB9AC \uB514\uC800\uD2B8"
        En: Slime Jelly Dessert
      - Id: 8028
        StringId: FOOD_001_DESC
        Ko: "\uB2EC\uCF64\uD55C \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uC824\uB9AC\uB97C \uAD73\uD600
          \uB9CC\uB4E0 \uB514\uC800\uD2B8. \uD68C\uBCF5 \uD6A8\uACFC\uAC00 \uC788\uB2E4."
        En: A dessert made by setting sweet slime jelly. Has a restorative effect.
      - Id: 8029
        StringId: FOOD_002_NAME
        Ko: "\uB9E4\uCF64 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uBCF6\uC74C"
        En: Spicy Slime Stir-fry
      - Id: 8030
        StringId: FOOD_002_DESC
        Ko: "\uBD88\uAF43 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uCF54\uC5B4\uB97C \uBCF6\uC544\uB0B8
          \uB9E4\uCF64\uD55C \uC694\uB9AC. \uACF5\uACA9\uB825\uC774 \uC624\uB978\uB2E4."
        En: A spicy stir-fry made from flame slime cores. Increases attack power.
      - Id: 8031
        StringId: FOOD_003_NAME
        Ko: "\uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0 \uBF08 \uC721\uC218"
        En: Goblin Bone Broth
      - Id: 8032
        StringId: FOOD_003_DESC
        Ko: "\uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0 \uBF08\uB97C \uC6B0\uB824\uB0B8 \uAE4A\uC740 \uC721\uC218.
          \uCCB4\uB825 \uD68C\uBCF5\uC5D0 \uD0C1\uC6D4\uD558\uB2E4."
        En: Rich stock simmered from goblin bones. Excellent for HP recovery.
      - Id: 8033
        StringId: FOOD_004_NAME
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F \uAC13 \uAD6C\uC774"
        En: Grilled Mushroom Cap
      - Id: 8034
        StringId: FOOD_004_DESC
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04\uC758 \uAC13\uC744 \uB450\uD23C\uD558\uAC8C
          \uC370\uC5B4 \uAD6C\uC6B4 \uC694\uB9AC. \uBC29\uC5B4\uB825\uC774 \uC624\uB978\uB2E4."
        En: Thick slices of mushroom cap seared in a pan. Increases defense.
      - Id: 8035
        StringId: FOOD_005_NAME
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC \uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uD06C"
        En: Green Worm Steak
      - Id: 8036
        StringId: FOOD_005_DESC
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC \uACE0\uAE30\uB97C \uB450\uAECD\uAC8C \uC36C \uACE0\uAE09
          \uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uD06C. \uBAA8\uB4E0 \uB2A5\uB825\uCE58\uAC00 \uC0C1\uC2B9\uD55C\uB2E4."
        En: A premium steak cut thick from green worm meat. Raises all stats.
      - Id: 8037
        StringId: RCP_001_NAME
        Ko: "\uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uC824\uB9AC \uB514\uC800\uD2B8 \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C"
        En: Slime Jelly Dessert Recipe
      - Id: 8038
        StringId: RCP_001_DESC
        Ko: "\uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uC824\uB9AC 2\uAC1C\uB97C \uD2C0\uC5D0 \uAD73\uD600
          \uC644\uC131\uD558\uB294 \uAE30\uBCF8 \uB514\uC800\uD2B8."
        En: A basic dessert. Set 2 slime jellies in a mold.
      - Id: 8039
        StringId: RCP_002_NAME
        Ko: "\uB9E4\uCF64 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uBCF6\uC74C \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C"
        En: Spicy Slime Stir-fry Recipe
      - Id: 8040
        StringId: RCP_002_DESC
        Ko: "\uBD88\uAF43 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784 \uCF54\uC5B4 1\uAC1C\uC640 \uC2AC\uB77C\uC784
          \uC824\uB9AC 1\uAC1C\uB97C \uBCF6\uB294\uB2E4."
        En: Stir-fry 1 flame slime core with 1 slime jelly.
      - Id: 8041
        StringId: RCP_003_NAME
        Ko: "\uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0 \uBF08 \uC721\uC218 \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C"
        En: Goblin Bone Broth Recipe
      - Id: 8042
        StringId: RCP_003_DESC
        Ko: "\uACE0\uBE14\uB9B0 \uBF08 3\uAC1C\uB97C \uC624\uB798 \uB053\uC5EC \uC721\uC218\uB97C
          \uB0B8\uB2E4."
        En: Simmer 3 goblin bones for a long time to extract rich broth.
      - Id: 8043
        StringId: RCP_004_NAME
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F \uAC13 \uAD6C\uC774 \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C"
        En: Grilled Mushroom Cap Recipe
      - Id: 8044
        StringId: RCP_004_DESC
        Ko: "\uBC84\uC12F\uC778\uAC04 \uAC13 2\uAC1C\uB97C \uD32C\uC5D0 \uAD7D\uB294\uB2E4."
        En: Grill 2 mushroom caps in a pan.
      - Id: 8045
        StringId: RCP_005_NAME
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC \uC2A4\uD14C\uC774\uD06C \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C"
        En: Green Worm Steak Recipe
      - Id: 8046
        StringId: RCP_005_DESC
        Ko: "\uADF8\uB9B0 \uC6DC \uACE0\uAE30 1\uAC1C\uB97C \uB450\uAECD\uAC8C \uC370\uC5B4
          \uAD7D\uB294 \uACE0\uAE09 \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C."
        En: A premium recipe. Cut 1 green worm meat thick and grill it.
      - Id: 8047
        StringId: UI_INTERACT
        Ko: "\uC0C1\uD638\uC791\uC6A9"
        En: Interact
